[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
REVYTECH wf-shell (panel / background / settings)

Config hierarchy:
  ~/.config/wf-shell.ini  and  ~/.config/wf-shell/config.json
  → else /usr/local/etc/wf-shell/wf-shell.ini

JSON config is validated on load/save; last-good backup at
  ~/.config/wf-shell/config.json.last-good
Invalid files are moved under ~/.config/wf-shell/quarantine/ for inspection.

Wallpapers:
  Bundled: /usr/local/share/wf-shell/backgrounds/
  Online feeds (Settings → Desktop) use curl(1) or FreeBSD fetch(1).
  curl is a package run-dependency for reliable HTTPS.

Launchers:
  /usr/local/libexec/wf-shell-launch {panel|background|dock}
  /usr/local/bin/wf-settings
EOM
}
]
